<title>USA: Citicorp to redeem pfd series 14 for cash.</title>
<headline>Citicorp to redeem pfd series 14 for cash.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp said Friday it would redeem for cash its 9.08 percent cumulative preferred stock, Series 14, and the related depositary shares.</p>
<p>The redemption will be at a price of $25 per depositary share, together with accrued and unpaid dividends up to March 17.</p>
<p>Citicorp said $175 million of the preferred stock is outstanding.</p>
<p>All depositary receipts should be surrendered to Citibank NA as redemption agent, the company said.</p>
</text>
